	(text_box "Supply: VDD_ANA and VDD_DIG are tied and run from the 1.8 V rail (allowed 1.7 to 2.0 V). 22 uF plus 100 nF on the supply, 1 uF on VREF, 10 uF on VLED. Keep C16 at the VDD_ANA ball. (MAX86141 datasheet p.12 and p.49)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 228.6 35.56 0) (size 56 12.2) (margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525) (stroke (width 0.1524) (type solid) (color 200 0 0 1)) (fill (type color) (color 160 195 245 1)) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e1ee33fb-e712-41cd-b67c-9e60c2a63b59"))
	(text_box "PGND, GND_ANA and GND_DIG meet at one ground. PD_GND is a separate net that touches ground at ONE point only, through net tie NT3 (datasheet layout guidelines p.49)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 228.6 50.76 0) (size 56 10.2) (margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525) (stroke (width 0.1524) (type solid) (color 200 0 0 1)) (fill (type color) (color 160 195 245 1)) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "36349195-08ce-45cb-8fc3-c90b95b6f52a"))
	(text_box "LED channel order follows MAXREFDES103: LED1 = green, LED2 = IR, LED3 = red. R6, R7 and R8 are 0 Ohm links so the LED current can be measured during bring-up." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 228.6 63.96 0) (size 56 10.2) (margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525) (stroke (width 0.1524) (type solid) (color 200 0 0 1)) (fill (type color) (color 160 195 245 1)) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "56c3b302-8e4e-42a4-9208-14adb79e353c"))
	(text_box "PPG_INT and PPG_GPIO1 are open-drain outputs, so R4 and R5 (100 kOhm) pull them up to 1.8 V. SDO is high impedance while CSB is high, so the SPI bus can be shared." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 228.6 77.16 0) (size 56 10.2) (margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525) (stroke (width 0.1524) (type solid) (color 200 0 0 1)) (fill (type color) (color 160 195 245 1)) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "fe53ea0f-5777-47f0-9963-9b690d6c7974"))
	(text_box "VEMD8080: anode is pin 5, cathodes are pins 1-4 and 6-8 (one net, drawn as one pin). Numbering and pad pattern checked against the Vishay package drawing (top view)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 228.6 90.36 0) (size 56 10.2) (margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525) (stroke (width 0.1524) (type solid) (color 200 0 0 1)) (fill (type color) (color 160 195 245 1)) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "f06f38b8-0ad5-485e-9cf5-f6b5e0f0671c"))
	(text_box "LED limits (SFH 7016): continuous current green 30 mA, red 40 mA, IR 60 mA; pulses 0.75 A, 0.3 A, 1 A at 0.5 % duty. Forward voltage at 20 mA: green 2.2 to 2.8 V, red 1.7 to 2.2 V, IR 1.1 to 1.5 V. Firmware must stay inside these." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 228.6 103.56 0) (size 56 12.2) (margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525) (stroke (width 0.1524) (type solid) (color 200 0 0 1)) (fill (type color) (color 160 195 245 1)) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "b111de84-a48d-4f87-a9af-57cb420c91cc"))
	(text_box "SPI: the MAX86141 allows SCLK up to 4 MHz, so keep the bus at or below 4 MHz while it is selected. SDO goes high impedance when CSB is high (shared bus with the flash)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 228.6 118.76 0) (size 56 10.2) (margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525) (stroke (width 0.1524) (type solid) (color 200 0 0 1)) (fill (type color) (color 160 195 245 1)) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "f2759e71-34b2-4f00-93f2-460a15cbb93d"))
	(text_box "VREF: the datasheet asks for 1 uF (C17). Maxim's MAXREFDES103 board fits 10 uF there. If the noise floor is higher than expected during bring-up, try 10 uF." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 228.6 131.96 0) (size 56 10.2) (margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525) (stroke (width 0.1524) (type solid) (color 200 0 0 1)) (fill (type color) (color 160 195 245 1)) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "644faa7a-75ed-44cc-a363-ba99e611638a"))
